{"id":"vod_md_5045","vodId":"5045","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"七大罪 愤怒的审判","name_cn":"七大罪 愤怒的审判","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230916-1/261c7615326b7d3d0618e8bc6f3a61c7.jpg"},"summary":"那还是人与非人的世界未曾分开的远古故事。流德雪尔率领的〈光之圣痕〉与魔神族的圣战，激化至波及布里塔尼亚全境。取得3个戒禁的艾斯塔罗萨失控暴走，带走了伊丽莎白。金、高瑟、霍克、沙利叶、塔米叶紧随其后，抵达了天空演舞场遗址。与此同时，在卡美洛城中，决定成为新魔神王的梅利奥达斯，在暗黑领域的茧中逐步获取戒禁。为了拯救梅利奥达斯的灵魂而将自身投入炼狱的班，徘徊于常人决无法存活的瘴气当中。逐渐明朗的艾斯塔罗萨的真正身份。崩坏的高瑟之禁咒。纠缠在一起的思绪将去往何方……真正的敌人是谁？应讨伐之人为何物？对抗“永远的生与永劫的轮回”这一命运，而持续了3000年旅程的梅利奥达斯与伊丽莎白。两人的旅途将会迎来怎样的结局——","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-16 08:44:45","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/UjiOfMcq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/SKqpvsaP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/HA5fCkB9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/MGCISlay/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/ywLwdKfy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/UVpbOqBk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/hkJVih1Z/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/v1fONRYd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/V35hvgM4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/olYGoPVI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/hZfnYZRC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/bJZwY78h/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/ciAb401V/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/IM1vcaP4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/ijN